(7672299, 1253009, 65234, '<td valign="top">So beautiful! It reminds me so much of crystal clear mornings after ice storms, when everything is sparkling. Prime photo opportunities then.</td>', 'So beautiful! It reminds me so much of crystal clear mornings after ice storms, when everything is sparkling. Prime photo opportunities then.', '2020-08-14 16:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
