(7672305, 1252650, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am feeling very sorry for that person standing there with an umbrella, clearly wanting to come in out of the storm. I think I might like this even better with more cropped off on the right. That green in the gap between buildings keeps drawing my eye.</td>', 'I am feeling very sorry for that person standing there with an umbrella, clearly wanting to come in out of the storm. I think I might like this even better with more cropped off on the right. That green in the gap between buildings keeps drawing my eye.', '2020-08-14 16:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
